# Guide chapters

- Smith owns synthesis from `source-notes/` into `guide/0*.md`.
- Every non-editorial claim should cite sources and use trust tags:
  `[settled]`, `[emerging]`, `[anecdotal]`, `[editorial]`, `[stale]`.
- Prefer incremental, citation-backed updates over rewriting whole chapters.
- Do not invent quotes or metrics — pull from merged source notes.
- `guide/SOURCES.md` is the master citation index; keep it consistent when
  adding material.
- Local edits: open a `guide-update` PR mindset; Assayer gates merge in CI.
